# Patterns without a leading **/ match the build context root only, so a bare
# `node_modules` would let every apps/*/node_modules and packages/*/node_modules
# (pnpm symlinks into the HOST store) into the image.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.turbo
**/dist
*.log
# Env files at any depth (apps/api/.env and the like hold real secrets). No image
# reads an example file; .env.example stays in only for parity with the tree.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
coverage
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
